## The Aesthetic Is Already Yours

The witchy nail world doesn't ask you to commit to black nails, long stilettos, or a season. It asks you to pick the corner that feels like yours  the celestial midnight blue you keep returning to, the forest green that just looks right, the matte mauve that makes your hands look like they belong to someone interesting  and wear it without apology.

<strong>Witchy nails</strong> at their best are personal rather than performative. Not a costume, not a trend moment, not something you put on in October and take off in November. The finish, the palette, the shape  these are tools. The aesthetic is the intention behind them. Find yours, and the rest follows.
